# Derived by hand from Language ch. 6, "Tick by tick" (a dynamic answer's first value is read in the birth tick; each later change is the next tick's input) and ruling PL (the host at 2, its answer under the guest's place in a list of its own).
test counted

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="add")
    2/0.[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="level 1")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click

tick 2
  changed:
    2/0.[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="level 2")
